{
  "id": "1CO.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Bakolinto 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsoogi kūlwa kūtwalīla beela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū mhayo gwa kūsooga kūlwa kūbagunanha beela, na a bing'we ītagi gīt'ūmo nakajiwīlīla kanisa ja Galatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lūshikū lo kwandya mu nyuma būlī ūmò wing'we ayūfunya shose shose gīt'ūmo kwīlūkīlwa kwakwe kūlī, ītizūbiza gīkī ūlū nalashike ko hū ng'wandye kūsooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nalize ko mukūsola abo mulababone bigeleelilwe nabatūme ī Yelusalemu, baje na nyalūba kūshitwala ī shakwinha shing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū yūbeelela nū nene naje, nakūja hamò nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhela mihayo ya ng'endo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalībītīla Makedonia, hūna ūlū nalīnge ko ī Makedonia nakwiza ūko mulī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo nīyo nakūlenda hamò ning'we, nūlīmalīla kwenūko ī likanza lya mbeho ya mu shiyaga, mulanigunanhe nū mu lūgendo lwane hose hose ūko najile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha natūtogagwa ū kūmubona ū kūnū najile, nguno nalisagīlwa kūshinga ning'we ikanza ūlū ūzunya ū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwikala Efeso kūshisha ikanza lya Pentekosite; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno napandīkile ng'wanya ntaale gwa kūtūmama, nūūlū īkī balīho bilwisha bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Timotheo ūlū alize ū kū bing'we nang'hanagi, atizūbiza wa kwikala wisūsa sūsaga kūlwa booba; nguno nū ng'wene ntūmami wa nīmo go ng'wa Seeba, gīt'ūmo nakwītīlaga dūhū ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū atizigela nūūlū ūmò wing'we wa kūndalaha. Mulangunaane ashoke mhola ū kūūnū nalī, nguno ū nene pye na a badūgū abo balīko ū kūūnū tūnindīīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ndūgū wise ū Apolo nakanomba no, gīkī ize ko hamò na a badūgū; alīyo jalī jitī ng'hūmbū jakwe kwiza ī haha, akwiza ūlū alapandīke ng'wanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūlanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilang'hanagi ng'wīmīīle mu kūzunya, hama ipandagi chanda muhandatīle; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pyī ī mihayo ying'we ībize mu būtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī nalīmulanja badūgū mumane gīkī, ī kaya ya ng'wa Stefana īl'itwajo lya kwandya ū mu Akaya; nīyo bifunya benekīlī kūlwa kūbagunanha beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bizagi na widohya ū kū banhū ba mbika yenīyo, nūūlū kūlī ūngī ose ose ūyo akūsangīlaga ū mu nīmo nū mu wilwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī nalī na būyegi kūlwa kwiza kwakwe ū Stefana, hamò nū Fotunato; pyī nū Kaiko, nguno banishikīlīgīgije īyo mukaleba ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagūzalanije ū moyo gwane, pyī nī ying'we. Hūna lūūlū, a banhū gītī benaba īng'wigeleelilwe mubitegeleje chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jilīmugīsha ī kanisa ja Asia; ū Akula nū Piliska, hamò nī kanisa īyo īlī mu kaya yabo balīmugīsha no mulī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a badūgū balīmugīsha. Igīshagi būlī ng'wene na biye mu kwibbipa kwela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Paulo namugīsha mu nkono gwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū alīho munhū atantogilwe Seeba leka azung'we. Malanasa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Malanasa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzūgū Seeba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba Yesu shibize hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būtogwa bone būlī hamò ning'we pye a bose mulī Kilisito Yesu: Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
